  "description": "The docs' captured output, under one scenario name for every edition: Java's captures are flat (docs/src/data/output/<name>.ansi), Rust's are in folders (docs/output/<folder>/<name>.ansi in mutastic-rs). scripts/check-editions.mjs compares each pair, masked, as warnings. A capture under a folder in `samePath` pairs with the other edition's at the same path. Add a scenario here when both editions capture the same command.",
